      "soft_memo": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>Python</strong>: Python is a versatile, high-level programming language known for its readability and simplicity. Used in various applications, from web development to data science, it&#39;s favored for its vast library ecosystem and supportive community.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong>R and RMarkdown</strong>: RMarkdown is a document format that enables embedding of R code into markdown documents, facilitating dynamic report generation. Used predominantly in the R programming ecosystem, it allows for the seamless integration of analysis, results, and narration.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong>Visual Studio code</strong>: Visual Studio Code is a code editor redefined and optimized for building and debugging modern web and cloud applications.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
